      value: Ok kid, easy part is over.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: Let's see if you can pull off a double wall run.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Just like before, run towards the wall press SPACEBAR and keep holding
        W. Don't forget jumping to the other wall.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: To slide press CTRL while holding W, if your'e not fast enough you won't
        be able to slide.
