      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: Great job.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'You can swing on bars to cover longer distances, just time your jump
        so you don''t fall. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: Right.....sorry.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: Ok you need to chain multiple wall climbs to be able to get to the top.
        you can combine up to three wall climbs at a time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: Press Q while climbing a wall then press SPACEBAR to move to the next
        wall.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1640901573787966622, guid: 7dd4573c638e8c495848395f8c285284, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[5].text
      value: If you think it's too dificult you can always climb the ladder.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
